+- Files changed: `internal/errors/errors.go`, `internal/errors/errors_test.go`, `internal/controlplane/apienvelope/apienvelope.go`, `internal/controlplane/apienvelope/apienvelope_test.go`, `internal/controlplane/apierr/apierr.go`, `internal/controlplane/apierr/apierr_test.go`, `internal/controlplane/store/job.go`, `internal/controlplane/worker/queue.go`, `internal/controlplane/worker/queue_test.go`, `internal/controlplane/worker/AGENTS.md`, `ralph/prd.json`, `ralph/progress.txt`.
+- Verification run: `gofmt -w .`; `go mod tidy`; `go test ./...`; `go test -race ./...`; `go vet ./...`; `go test ./internal/controlplane/...`; `go test -race ./internal/controlplane/...`; `go test -run TestMigrations ./...`; `go test -run TestFakeDokploy ./...`; `golangci-lint run ./...`.
+- Results: All verification commands passed. `goimports`, `staticcheck`, and `govulncheck` were not installed in this environment.
+- Remaining risks or follow-ups: None for this story. Adjacent error-contract stories remain unfinished in `ralph/prd.json`.
+- **Learnings for future iterations:**
+  - Worker queue outcome commits must verify the current lease owner inside the locked repository transition, not only rely on the stale in-memory lease object returned by `Claim`.
+  - `E_JOB_NOT_CLAIMED` is a 409 conflict-class queue coordination error; use it when a stale worker no longer owns the job lease and should not record success/failure/retry over a newer owner.
